**/tests/**
# ...except the ones that are the project's own test suite. Without this, a new
# test file is invisible to `git add` and lives only on the machine that wrote
# it — which is how the livestream naming tests went two sessions unshared.
!dataset_builder/tests/
!dataset_builder/tests/*.py
**/.extras/**
telegram/links-for-tests.txt

Portable-Tor-Proxy-Rotator/
